OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of manslaughter after
OL,4,A2022 bus stop attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been found guilty of killing
OL,7,Fa bus passenger he assaulted at a stop
OL,8,Fin Wigston.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Police said Darren
OL,11,FBakewell punched and pushed Christopher
OL,12,FPearson, 78, following an exchange in
OL,13,FLong Street on 15 October 2022, causing
OL,14,Fhim to fall backwards on to a low brick
OL,15,Fwall and metal railings.
OL,17,FPearson died in hospital 10 days later
OL,18,Fafter suffering complications arising
OL,19,Ffrom his injuries from the assault,
OL,20,Fwith police investigations establishing
OL,21,Fa link between the attack and his
OL,22,Fdeath.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
