OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of manslaughter after
OL,4,A2022 bus stop attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FBakewell, 62, of Bentinghouse Gardens
OL,7,Fin Leicester, was found guilty of
OL,8,Fmanslaughter at Leicester Crown Court
OL,9,Fon Monday. He has been released on bail
OL,10,Fand is due to be sentenced on 9
OL,11,FOctober.
